# `The nine acts of capability routing (issue #1138 B10, plan 10 leaf 6).`
#
# `Capability is a function of the object in the request, the act asked for,`
# `and where the effect lands. Verbs select the *act*; they never select the`
# `capability. This file is the one place per-language verb surfaces remain,`
# `and it is shared by every capability -- so adding a language is nine`
# `blocks here rather than eleven per-capability cue lists, and the asymmetry`
# `that let "search" reach web_search while "find" reached read_file cannot`
# `recur in any direction.`
#
# `Surfaces are stems, read as raw substrings, because an imperative is`
# `inflected in every language the corpus covers.`
